<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $2.3 million Italian Open men's tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Marzio Martelli (Italy) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>15-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Jerome Golmard (France) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) beat Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 6-3 6-2  </p>
<p>Emilio Alvarez (Spain) beat Francisco Clavet (Spain) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>5-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Diego Nargiso (Italy) 7-5</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat 16-Mark Philippoussis (Australia)</p>
<p>6-2 6-0</p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) beat Greg Rusedski (Britian) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Holland) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>10-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Christian Ruud (Norway) beat Frederik Fetterlein (Denmark) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat 9-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) 4-6 7-5 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline (France) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 6-4 6-3  </p>
<p>8-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Stefano Pescosolido (Italy) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
